The file is bound to codex's Session, SessionIo and Op types. What transfers:
a delegate's cancellation is a child of the parent's, so a parent stop
cascades (`child_token`; here the loop's Stop notifies every attempt's
cancel); delegate events are forwarded to the parent (`forward_events`; here
the forwarder appends them to the worker's transcript); delegates never ask
for approval on the parent's behalf (approval policy `never`; here a worker
has no ask resolver unless its route sets one); model fallback is off
(`allow_provider_model_fallback: false`; here a route is one model).

